OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,6,     F5/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,7,     FMendelssohn's homecoming and his
OL,8,     Fsearch for a lasting musical
OL,9,     Flegacy.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FKatie Derham is joined in the
OL,12,     Fstudio for a live performance by
OL,13,     Fbassoonist Amy Harman ahead of her
OL,14,     FProm with Academy of St Martins in
OL,15,     Fthe Fields.
