OL,5,G2200 Late Junction
OL,6,     FLauren Martin joins Jennifer Lucy
OL,7,     FAllan to explore the seismic
OL,8,     Fimpact of dubstep on the world of
OL,9,     Fexperimental listening. Plus new
OL,10,     Freleases for adventurous ears.
OL,11,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,12,     FSaxophonist Soweto Kinch picks
OL,13,     Fjazz from all eras, with a focus
OL,14,     Fon new British artists.
OL,15,G0030 Through the Night
OL,16,     FCellist Senja Rummukainen joins
OL,17,     Fthe Finnish Radio Symphony
OL,18,     FOrchestra and conductor Andrew
OL,19,     FManze in Elgar's cello concerto.
